# Phase 5A: allow-list. Only what `:server:installDist` needs enters the Docker build context; everything else (apps, docs, local
# data, IDE files, credentials) is never sent to the builder or baked into a layer.
*
!gradlew
!gradle/
!settings.gradle.kts
!build.gradle.kts
!gradle.properties
!core/
!server/

# Even inside the allowed folders: no build outputs, caches, local data or anything credential-like.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
server/data/
**/local.properties
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*service-account*.json
**/*serviceAccount*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/*-key.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/*.iml
